WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.101
Set up what you want to learn in
SkillPilot once. Then learn with your

2
00:00:05.101 --> 00:00:09.531
coach in chat. We’ll use Claude to show
how to get started.

3
00:00:10.031 --> 00:00:16.620
Open SkillPilot dot com and choose Learn
now. Read the notices and terms of use. If

4
00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:20.002
you agree, accept them to continue.

5
00:00:20.725 --> 00:00:27.056
Create a SkillPilot ID or load the one you
already have. Save a new ID as a protected

6
00:00:27.056 --> 00:00:31.696
file so you can find your learning
progress again later.

7
00:00:32.196 --> 00:00:37.226
Choose your curriculum and set what you
want to learn. In this example, we choose

8
00:00:37.226 --> 00:00:41.883
lower secondary mathematics in the
nine-year Gymnasium track in Hesse,

9
00:00:41.883 --> 00:00:45.167
Germany. Confirm your selection to
continue.

10
00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:51.484
Choose the Claude learning coach. On your
first visit, select Set up plugin to open

11
00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:56.798
the guide. If Claude is already set up,
choose Start learning with Claude.

12
00:00:57.298 --> 00:01:03.068
To get started with Claude, you need a Pro
subscription. In Claude Web, open

13
00:01:03.068 --> 00:01:09.306
Settings, then Plugins. Choose Add, Add
marketplace, then Add from a repository.

14
00:01:09.306 --> 00:01:15.389
Paste the address shown on screen. Leave
Automatically sync on and select Sync.

15
00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:35.436
Open Discover and find SkillPilot Coach
version one from the marketplace. Check

16
00:01:35.436 --> 00:01:41.669
the offered version against the SkillPilot
guide. Select Add and check that the

17
00:01:41.669 --> 00:01:48.064
plugin is enabled. Open Connectors, select
SkillPilot, then Connect. Sign in and

18
00:01:48.064 --> 00:01:53.173
approve access. Once you see Connected,
return to SkillPilot.

19
00:02:03.855 --> 00:02:09.581
Back in SkillPilot, choose Start learning
with Claude. The start message is already

20
00:02:09.581 --> 00:02:14.826
filled in in the new chat. Send it as it
is. Sign in if asked and keep the message

21
00:02:14.826 --> 00:02:16.226
private.

22
00:02:17.212 --> 00:02:23.106
After orientation, with Autopilot off, you
choose one of the available goals in chat.

23
00:02:23.106 --> 00:02:28.650
Here, you start with the number line. The
coach asks where four hundred and seven

24
00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:33.143
and four hundred and seventy go on a
number line marked in tens.

25
00:02:33.643 --> 00:02:38.935
When Autopilot is on, SkillPilot picks
from the same available goals. Your coach

26
00:02:38.935 --> 00:02:42.334
tells you the choice and guides you in the
chat.

27
00:02:42.834 --> 00:02:47.579
Choose goals and learning units in chat.
Ask for a practice task or an available

28
00:02:47.579 --> 00:02:52.266
assessment. Pause and resume when you
like. The Cockpit and learning map give

29
00:02:52.266 --> 00:02:55.005
you an overview whenever you want one.
